    "detailed_description": "<h1>FEATURES</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>An army of weirdos</strong> - Every enemy is a unique encounter, each testing the limits of your party and item management. <br></li><li><strong>A branching story</strong> - Your actions and words have far-ranging consequences. Making enemies is usually a bad thing, but maybe you\u2019d like the extra challenge\u2026?<br></li><li><strong>A world of secrets</strong> - Confront strange landscapes and stranger foes when you travel off the beaten trail in pursuit of loot and EXP. <br></li><li><strong>A beast</strong> - Something is coming.</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred years in the future, the dregs of the human race struggle to survive in a contradictory world of VIOLENCE, MAGIC, and LIVING CARTOONS.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the sheltered psychic <strong>Beau Chartreuse</strong> in a turn-based RPG journey through the ruins of California, meeting strange assets and stranger enemies. A world where brutality reigns supreme and kindness is never easy\u2026 A world that frays at the edges, allowing something wonderful in! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/ac86deb335bbcf00c3e12cafd2564ce6.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is a lot for just you and Beau, so it\u2019s good that you\u2019ve got some strong allies on your side! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, I\u2019m sorry. It\u2019s just a fox and an old man. They\u2019re both bitter and full of regrets, but who isn\u2019t? I\u2019m sure that Valentine and Dr. Woland will have their uses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or they may stab you in the back. You can never be sure of people, these days. Best not to get too attached.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/747872aaf35dc5874c5d353bb7e79b4d.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE OPPOSITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men and women, clowns and dreams and cartoons and nightmares! This world is full of things that will want to take your money, your life, or something worse. <br>With every enemy a unique encounter, it\u2019s up to you to decide exactly how much you\u2019re willing to bite off!  <br>Will you blaze through the world, hunting for every enemy while putting your party\u2019s health at risk? Or will you cautiously hoard your money and food for those foes you can\u2019t avoid? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eh? Why are they fighting you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026Let\u2019s not ask questions without happy answers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/c0f8d5aec6a734039631f2e5a9ee5740.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not all doom and gloom. There\u2019s whispers of something coming, sent by Heaven itself. Something that\u2019ll shake up this dying world and make way for a new paradigm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m sure that you\u2019ll love to meet it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/768feddf59e66aef18bf7420581fd7bd.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred years in the future, the dregs of the human race struggle to survive in a contradictory world of VIOLENCE, MAGIC, and LIVING CARTOONS.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the sheltered psychic <strong>Beau Chartreuse</strong> in a turn-based RPG journey through the ruins of California, meeting strange assets and stranger enemies. A world where brutality reigns supreme and kindness is never easy\u2026 A world that frays at the edges, allowing something wonderful in! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/ac86deb335bbcf00c3e12cafd2564ce6.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is a lot for just you and Beau, so it\u2019s good that you\u2019ve got some strong allies on your side! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, I\u2019m sorry. It\u2019s just a fox and an old man. They\u2019re both bitter and full of regrets, but who isn\u2019t? I\u2019m sure that Valentine and Dr. Woland will have their uses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or they may stab you in the back. You can never be sure of people, these days. Best not to get too attached.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/747872aaf35dc5874c5d353bb7e79b4d.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE OPPOSITION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Men and women, clowns and dreams and cartoons and nightmares! This world is full of things that will want to take your money, your life, or something worse. <br>With every enemy a unique encounter, it\u2019s up to you to decide exactly how much you\u2019re willing to bite off!  <br>Will you blaze through the world, hunting for every enemy while putting your party\u2019s health at risk? Or will you cautiously hoard your money and food for those foes you can\u2019t avoid? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eh? Why are they fighting you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026Let\u2019s not ask questions without happy answers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/c0f8d5aec6a734039631f2e5a9ee5740.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BEAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not all doom and gloom. There\u2019s whispers of something coming, sent by Heaven itself. Something that\u2019ll shake up this dying world and make way for a new paradigm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m sure that you\u2019ll love to meet it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2250330/extras/768feddf59e66aef18bf7420581fd7bd.avif?t=1750955733\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "PLAY ROUGH is a roleplaying game set in the surreal, post-apocalyptic wasteland of what was once California. It's a place where humans live side-by-side with living cartoons, twisted abominations of ink and flesh, and... Clowns...?",
